# To Catch a Falling Star (windurst 53): the trades while available, and 196's finish with a non-zero option.
# Sigismund: the tear: nothing (not accepted). The Twinkle Tree at 03:00 and at 00:00 with the scales: nothing (not
# accepted). Sigismund's 196 finish begins the quest on any option (the Lua's addQuest ignores it): option 1 begins it,
# and his next talk is 197.
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-109.04,-9.0,80.56 job=WAR lvl=75
item StarfallTear
item HandfulOfPugilScales x2
login
trigger Sigismund                       # available: 196 (0, 546)
finish option=1                         # begun (any option)
trigger Sigismund                       # accepted: 197 (0, 546)
finish
quest Windurst.ToCatchAFallingStar available
trigger Sigismund                       # available again (a GM's delQuest): 196 (0, 546)
finish option=2                         # begun (any option)
quest Windurst.ToCatchAFallingStar available
trade Sigismund StarfallTear x1         # available: nothing
warp 154.5,-40.75,333.7 WestSarutabaruta
wait vana=15                            # 03:00
trade Twinkle_Tree HandfulOfPugilScales x1  # not accepted, hour 3: nothing
wait vana=21                            # 00:00
trade Twinkle_Tree HandfulOfPugilScales x1  # not accepted, hour 0: nothing
